        "title": "Add ruleset selector to beatmap info overlay",
        "body": "**Describe the new feature:** \r\nIn the gray area above the beatmap page on osu!lazer, I would recommend adding tabs for beatmaps that are specific for different osu modes. This is already fixed on the website, but it doesn't exist in lazer.\r\n![osu_2019-06-21_18-34-28](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/32044067/59925334-7f46fb00-9455-11e9-9000-6c7be7ca055a.jpg)\r\n\r\n**Proposal designs of the feature:** \r\nAdd navigation tabs for `osu!`, `osu!ctb`, `osu!catch`, and `osu!mania` on the gray area above the beatmap page overlay on Lazer(designed like on the website).",
        "comments": [
            "I believe this will be resolved with the upcoming redesign of this page, web and client,",
